{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026E3NoLmtjom1795129292.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美元匯價持續上升，金價連跌四日，跌穿3,700美元一盎司。</p><p></p><p>現貨金價曾跌至3,621.68美元一盎司，跌103.7美元，跌幅近百分之2.8，見去年9月以來低位。</p><p></p><p>Everbank全球市場主管加夫尼表示，加息預期加上強美元，是金價下挫主因。他指出，聯儲局上月議息會議紀要顯示，幾乎所有與會委員預期，利率將進一步上升，而近期公布的通脹數據，同樣支持美國需要加息。利率期貨市場顯示，下月加息機會超過九成六。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T00:24:09.704828+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":200,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T23:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T23:49:19.782597+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T00:17:17.345997+00:00","content_hash":"57edf57b020def083a0ee31d7a47c583332b28ce6de0af7e22c862dd9a38b8f7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-20T00:24:09.704828+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}